WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.643
- [Man] If somebody is extremely
passionate about something that

00:00:02.643 --> 00:00:04.647
doesn't come naturally to them,--
- Yes.

00:00:04.647 --> 00:00:06.941
- should they not pursue it
because it's not a strength or

00:00:06.941 --> 00:00:08.909
should they go for it anyway
because they love that shit?

00:00:08.909 --> 00:00:12.484
- Bro, I'm so pumped you 
asked this question.

00:00:12.484 --> 00:00:14.944
I'm glad we're getting 
to say it here.

00:00:14.944 --> 00:00:18.529
If you're not great at it
but you love it more than life

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:20.651
should you go after it?

00:00:20.651 --> 00:00:23.497
To me, the answer is yes.

00:00:23.497 --> 00:00:25.910
- [Man] Hell yeah, hell yeah.
- The problem is please

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:29.926
also recognize you're 
probably not gonna get rich.

00:00:29.926 --> 00:00:32.690
If you love basketball 
more than life,

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:36.779
it's just what you always loved,
you might just make

00:00:36.779 --> 00:00:40.576
$49,000 a year being a 
basketball coach and having

00:00:40.576 --> 00:00:43.890
a lot of time on your hands
to play basketball.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:47.627
It's just you got to understand,
you can't have everything

00:00:47.627 --> 00:00:50.710
all the time, always.
It's just life.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:53.001
I think happiness 
trumps everything.

00:00:53.001 --> 00:00:56.062
Easy for me to say because
it really worked out for me.

00:00:56.062 --> 00:00:59.496
'Cause happiness coincides 
with financial upside.

00:00:59.496 --> 00:01:02.276
I have friends who make 
$74,000 a year that are just

00:01:02.276 --> 00:01:04.300
happier people than 
friends that are making

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.460
$18 million a year that are not.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.754
You've got to do you but
please don't let the

00:01:09.754 --> 00:01:13.281
entrepreneurial society, don't 
let me, don't let your parents

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:17.821
push you in to what success is.
It's different for all of us.

00:01:17.821 --> 00:01:20.609
But, and this is the big but,

00:01:20.609 --> 00:01:23.006
you've got to be 
self-aware about it.

00:01:23.006 --> 00:01:27.186
(upbeat electronica music)

